## Scope note: vendored assets under `server/assets/` are not covered by this licence

The MIT grant above covers this repository's own source code and
documentation. It does **not** extend to the third-party and
separately-licensed works vendored under `server/assets/`, which carry
their own terms:

- **Fonts** (`server/assets/fonts/`) — the Inter, Zilla Slab, and PT Serif
  families are each licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  (OFL 1.1), not MIT.
- **Icons** (`server/assets/icons/plane-takeoff.*`, `plane-landing.*`) — the
  Lucide-derived glyphs are licensed under the ISC License, not MIT.
- **Illustrations** (`server/assets/icons/illustrations/`) — AI-generated
  originals with their own separate provenance treatment, not MIT-licensed
  source code.

See the `VENDOR.md` file in each of those directories for the full
per-file source, licence text, and provenance detail. Do not assume the MIT
grant above extends to any file under `server/assets/`.
